---Retrieve EXFOR data from SQL database---
___getConnSQLite: file:../../x4sqlite1.db?mode=rw
Connected to: [sqlite3]
___getX4SqlSearchDA_a: Li-6 p,he3
SQL:
select *                           
 ,round(An) as Anint               
from da1                           
where (Target like 'Li-6')   
  and (Reaction like 'p,he3')  
 and (An>=164 and An<=166)
order by fullCode,                 
  YearRef1 desc,DatasetID          
  ,Anint,En,iPoint                 


